<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif; font-size: 8.5pt; color: #1a1a1a; }
        h1 { font-size: 14pt; margin: 0 0 4pt; }
        h2 { font-size: 10.5pt; margin: 14pt 0 5pt; }
        .meta { margin: 0 0 8pt; color: #555; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        th, td { padding: 3pt 4pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #ccc; text-align: right; }
        th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; }
        thead th { background: #f0f0f0; font-weight: bold; }
        tr.total td { font-weight: bold; border-top: 1pt solid #1a1a1a; }
        .note { border: 0.5pt solid #999; padding: 6pt 8pt; margin: 10pt 0; font-size: 8pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
{% set currency = loan.space.currency %}
{% set combined = schedule.combined %}

<h1>Échéancier d'emprunt — {{ loan.bankName }}</h1>
<p class="meta">
    {{ loan.property.name }} · fonds débloqués le {{ loan.startDate|date_short }}<br>
    Capital emprunté {{ schedule.borrowedCapital|money(currency) }} ·
    Coût du crédit {{ combined.totalCost()|money(currency) }}
    (intérêts {{ combined.totalInterest|money(currency) }} + assurance {{ combined.totalInsurance|money(currency) }})
</p>

<div class="note">
    <strong>Échéancier théorique.</strong> Calculé sur les termes du dossier : taux fixe, mensualité constante
    par ligne, première échéance un mois après le déblocage, assurance sur le capital de la ligne.
    Il ne reflète pas les paiements effectivement réglés. Seule la part intérêts + assurance est déductible
    des revenus fonciers au régime réel.
</div>

<h2>Récapitulatif par année</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Année</th>
            <th>Échéances</th>
            <th>Capital</th>
            <th>Intérêts</th>
            <th>Assurance</th>
            <th>Déductible</th>
            <th>Total versé</th>
            <th>Capital restant dû</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for year in combined.years %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ year.year }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.instalmentCount }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.capitalPart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.interestPart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.insurancePart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.deductiblePart()|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.totalPayment|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ year.remainingCapital|money(currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Détail mois par mois</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>N°</th>
            <th>Échéance</th>
            <th>Capital</th>
            <th>Intérêts</th>
            <th>Assurance</th>
            <th>Total</th>
            <th>Capital restant dû</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in combined.rows %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ row.monthNumber }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.dueDate|date_short }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.capitalPart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.interestPart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.insurancePart|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.totalPayment|money(currency) }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.remainingCapital|money(currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>
